<title>SRI LANKA: Commercial Bank says '96 net up 31.7.</title>
<headline>Commercial Bank says '96 net up 31.7.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Commercial Bank Ltd for the financial year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1996		 1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	 3,365.22   vs    2,727.20</p>
<p>     Net profit	 433.36   vs	329.03</p>
<p>     Tax provision    147.00   vs	160.00</p>
<p>NOTE - The blue chip Commercial Bank Ltd is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
